Open Vanilla 0023 — the name in game and on the realm's pages says Open Vanilla.

* The game's loading-screen tips ("Open Vanilla runs in your browser…", "…every Open Vanilla addon…"),
  the realm's log lines, the Discord sign-in user agent, and the comments in the realm's pages,
  scripts and sources: the old name -> Open Vanilla. Text only; no behaviour changes.
* Database migrations are deliberately untouched: the realm checks applied migrations against their
  checksums, so even a comment change there would stop a live realm from starting.
* Applies after 0022. All wenilla-realm tests pass.

